    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
